  "description": "HIXCAW crystallizes in the trigonal crystal system with space group P -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C36 H56 F36 La6 O50 S12 2-,2(C15 H34 N1 O6 1+). From the CIF bond table, La2 (La) has 10 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La5 (La) has 10 O neighbors; La6 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La7 (La) has 10 O neighbors; La8 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La9 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La10 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La11 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La12 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La13 (La) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 24 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.191-4.235 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 110.76-114.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [H2]2[La6(OH)8(OTf)12(THF)6] (C36H56F36La6O50S12)2-·2(C15H34NO6)+. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
